@startuml
[*] --> Greeting : UserArrives
Greeting --> PINCheck : CardInserted
PINCheck --> MainMenu : CorrectPinEntered
MainMenu --> Processing : OptionSelected
Processing --> MainMenu : RequestProcessed
PINCheck --> IncorrectPin : IncorrectPinEntered
IncorrectPin --> PINCheck : RetryAttempted
IncorrectPin --> CardRetained : TooManyFailedAttempts
CardRetained --> Greeting : UserCancels
CardRetained --> TerminalState : CardReturned
TerminalState --> [*] : ProcessComplete
@enduml
